                        sling:resourceType="weekender/components/text"
                        text="&lt;p&gt;© 2026 Weekender.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p&gt;Weekender is a fictitious adventure and travel site: the demo of &lt;a href=&quot;https://sensiblestudio.io&quot;&gt;Sensible Studio&lt;/a&gt;. It is built from Core Components, editable templates and content fragments, and the same project runs unchanged on Adobe Experience Manager. It started from the WKND reference site by Adobe, published under the MIT licence; the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Sensible-Studio/weekender&quot;&gt;source code&lt;/a&gt; is open.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p&gt;The photos are by contributors of Wikimedia Commons, each under a licence that lets anybody use it. &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Sensible-Studio/weekender/blob/main/IMAGES.md&quot;&gt;Who made which&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;"
